@startuml 01_context
title System Context: PKB Semantic Search

actor "User\n(personal note author)" as User
actor "Evaluator\n(researcher)" as Evaluator
actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor

rectangle "PKB Semantic Search System" as System

cloud "Embedding model provider\n(local sentence-transformers\nor cloud embedding API)" as EmbProvider
database "Notes source\n(user's text notes)" as Notes

User --> System : writes notes, searches,\nviews ranked results
Evaluator --> System : labels queries,\nruns evaluation, reads metrics
Supervisor ..> System : reviews docs and\nrepository history (indirect)

System --> EmbProvider : requests embeddings\nfor chunks and queries
EmbProvider --> System : returns vectors\n(dense representations)
System --> Notes : imports and stores notes
@enduml
